This package is a partial TypeScript port of OpenVDB 13.0.1 and NanoVDB
32.9.1, with additions from OpenVDB 10.1.0, included only to support
OpenUSD's use of OpenVDB (see README.md). It is not affiliated with,
endorsed by, or sponsored by the OpenVDB project or the Academy Software
Foundation. The @vdb/openvdb and @vdb/nanovdb package names and the source
layout mirror the upstream source tree; they imply no affiliation, and no
trademark rights are claimed or granted.

